{"kind":"doc","route":"/learn/09-routing","title":"9. Wire up routing","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"_9-wire-up-routing","children":[{"t":"text","text":"9. Wire up routing"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Goal:"}]},{"t":"text","text":" put the tasks page behind a route, and make a missing provider a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"compile error"}]},{"t":"text","text":" instead of a blank screen."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The headline is this: "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"navigation only accepts routes that exist"}]},{"t":"text","text":". Not a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"string"},{"t":"text","text":" you hope is right — a value checked against the paths your app actually"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declares. A typo, a removed route, a missing param: all compile errors, at the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"call site."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This is where the dev tooling earns its keep."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"declare-the-route","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Declare the route"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A Craft component is mounted with "},{"t":"code","text":"loadCraftComponent(...)"},{"t":"text","text":", spread into the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"route:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { loadCraftComponent } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftRoutes } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens"